


Release notes for VAXCOM, version of March 1982.
===============================================

The files on this disk contain the following things:

VAXCOM.PA	PAL-8 source program. Includes complete
		copy of OS8 character-oriented IO routines
		given in Appendix F of OS/8 Software Support
		Manual.

VAXCOM.SV	Assembled and saved program. Runs with KL8-J
		board (with device codes 36 and 37) connected
		to VAX terminal line.

VAXCOM.WU	Write-up of the program. Contains operating
		instructions, information about set-up, and
		listings of VAX/VMS Command Procedures used
		to control file transfers.

TOPDP.CM	Copy of VAX/VMS Command Procedure to control
		file transfer to PDP8.

TOVAX.CM	Ditto, for file transfer to VAX.

README.TX	A brief description of what is in each file
		on this disk. Should perhaps be read first.
